{"id":"t30","n":"Teskari trigonometrik funksiyalar","q":[[1,"arctg(1) ni gradusda toping.","45°",["arctg qiymatlari sohasi: (−π/2; π/2)","tg 45° = 1","arctg(1) = 45°"]],[1,"arctg(0) ni radianda toping.","0",["arctg qiymatlari sohasi: (−π/2; π/2)","tg(0) = 0","arctg(0) = 0"]],[1,"arccos x = π/4 bo'lsa, x ni toping.","√2/2",["arccos x = π/4 → x = cos(π/4)","x = √2/2"]],[1,"arctg x = 0 bo'lsa, x ni toping.","0",["arctg x = 0 → x = tg(0)","x = 0"]],[1,"arcsin x = π/2 bo'lsa, x ni toping.","1",["arcsin x = π/2 → x = sin(π/2)","x = 1"]],[1,"arctg x = 45° bo'lsa, x ni toping.","1",["arctg x = 45° → x = tg 45°","x = 1"]],[1,"arcsin(1) ni radianda toping.","π/2",["arcsin qiymatlari sohasi: [−π/2; π/2]","sin(π/2) = 1","arcsin(1) = π/2"]],[1,"arcsin(√3/2) ni radianda toping.","π/3",["arcsin qiymatlari sohasi: [−π/2; π/2]","sin(π/3) = √3/2","arcsin(√3/2) = π/3"]],[1,"arccos 0 ni gradusda toping.","90°",["cos 90° = 0","arccos 0 = 90°"]],[1,"arcctg x = 45° bo'lsa, x ni toping.","1",["arcctg x = 45° → x = ctg 45°","x = 1"]],[1,"arctg(√3) ni radianda toping.","π/3",["arctg qiymatlari sohasi: (−π/2; π/2)","tg(π/3) = √3","arctg(√3) = π/3"]],[1,"arcctg(1) ni gradusda toping.","45°",["arcctg qiymatlari sohasi: (0; π)","ctg 45° = 1","arcctg(1) = 45°"]],[1,"arccos x = π/2 bo'lsa, x ni toping.","0",["arccos x = π/2 → x = cos(π/2)","x = 0"]],[1,"arcsin √2/2 ni gradusda toping.","45°",["sin 45° = √2/2","arcsin √2/2 = 45°"]],[2,"tg(arccos(−3/5)) ni hisoblang.","−4/3",["α = arccos(−3/5): cos α = −3/5, α ∈ [0; π] → sin α ≥ 0","sin α = 4/5, cos α = −3/5","tg α = −4/3"]],[2,"arctg x = 60° bo'lsa, x ni toping.","√3",["arctg x = 60° → x = tg 60°","x = √3"]],[2,"ctg(arctg(−9/40)) ni hisoblang.","−40/9",["α = arctg(−9/40): tg α = −9/40, α ∈ (−π/2; π/2) → cos α > 0","sin α = −9/41, cos α = 40/41","ctg α = −40/9"]],[2,"ctg(arcsin(4/5)) ni hisoblang.","3/4",["α = arcsin(4/5): sin α = 4/5, α ∈ (−π/2; π/2) → cos α > 0","sin α = 4/5, cos α = 3/5","ctg α = 3/4"]],[2,"arcctg(−√3) ni radianda toping.","5π/6"